	(text "CMS-011 | NOR series and idle states\nR54-R63: 10 x 30R, 0.1%, 25 ppm/C.\n100 C departure from reference temperature:\nRmin = 30 x 0.999 x 0.9975 = 29.895075 ohm\nRmax = 30 x 1.001 x 1.0025 = 30.105075 ohm\nWithin JESD251 30R +/-1%: 29.7..30.3 ohm.\nExternal parts remain required; SI check OPEN.\n\nR64 CS pull: 10k; R65 INT pull: 47k.\n1%, 100 ppm/C, 100 C: factors 0.9801..1.0201.\nAt 4uA adverse leakage, rail min 3.242044 V:\nCS Vhigh >= 3.242044 - 4u x 10201 = 3.201240 V\nINT Vhigh >= 3.242044 - 4u x 47944.7 = 3.050265 V\nINT Ilow <= 3.6/46064.7 + 2u = 80.150949 uA\n< 100uA flash VOL test; 47k departs from 5-10k.\nRC timing and board leakage qualification OPEN.\n\nLinked CMS-011B/C/F: sources and Python checks.\nMCU hierarchy and common reset connected.\nDS is read-only: P801 input, WRMSKMD=0.\nCMS-011D defines reset and protocol recovery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 164.846 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-011c-pull-and-common-reset-arithmetic")
		)
		(uuid "18d4ef73-0341-4ce2-81e6-ceda0da87e84")
	)
	(text "CMS-011 | NOR supply and bypass\nU15B VCC and VCCQ share +3V3_MCU (2.7 to 3.6 V).\nC89-C91: 3 x 100 nF, one per supply ball.\nC92: 10 uF local bulk.\nCnom = 3 x 0.1 + 10 = 10.3 uF.\nInitial +/-10%: Cmin/max = 10.3 x (0.9 / 1.1)\n= 9.27 / 11.33 uF; not an effective-C guarantee.\nIncluded in the PWR-003 1 mF whole-rail limit.\nDC bias, temperature, aging and PDN qualification OPEN.\nLinked CMS-011B/F: sources and Python-verified arithmetic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.346 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-011b-series-default-state-and-local-supply-components")
		)
		(uuid "a9ed9069-8e7a-4cab-88ec-2a1ce6c5d680")
	)
